[
    {
        "id": "4545b853eee3bf43",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Cyclotron Dashboard",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Dashboard CADANGAN Node-RED untuk Siklotron DECY-13 (Divisi 6).\n\nSumber data : topic MQTT decy13/rpi/state (state NYATA dari daemon RPi, ~5 Hz, 22 field kontrak).\nPerintah    : POST /api/control -> divalidasi -> publish {\"cmd\": ...} ke decy13/hmi/cmd (tidak retained).\nHalaman     : http://<host-node-red>:1880/dashboard\nTidak ada simulasi fisika dan tidak ada akses GPIO langsung: semua perangkat keras dikendalikan daemon RPi."
    },
    {
        "id": "cmt_arsitektur",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "4545b853eee3bf43",
        "name": "ALUR: MQTT state -> context -> /api/status -> browser; browser -> /api/control -> MQTT cmd",
        "info": "1. mqtt in decy13/rpi/state -> 'Simpan State & Statistik' (global: decy13_state, decy13_meta).\n2. GET /api/status membaca context dan menghitung status link (online jika paket < 2 s), Hz, interval maks.\n3. POST /api/control memvalidasi perintah (whitelist kontrak) lalu publish ke decy13/hmi/cmd.\n4. POST /api/sensor dipertahankan sebagai jalur fallback HTTP dan memakai penyimpan state yang sama.",
        "x": 330,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "cmt_gpio",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "4545b853eee3bf43",
        "name": "JANGAN tambahkan node pi-gpiod: GPIO 17/18/21/22 milik modul daemon RPi",
        "info": "Relay kipas (GPIO 21), buzzer (GPIO 17), LED WS2812B (GPIO 18, DMA PWM0) dan E-Stop (GPIO 22) dikendalikan oleh modul daemon RPi. Node-RED yang ikut menulis pin yang sama akan bentrok, terutama GPIO 18 yang membawa data LED strip.",
        "x": 330,
        "y": 560,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "1074a57897769b93",
        "type": "http in",
        "z": "4545b853eee3bf43",
        "name": "GET /cyclotron",
        "url": "/cyclotron",
        "method": "get",
        "upload": false,
        "skipBodyParsing": false,
